WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:04.045
Unit five. Online Privacy!

2
00:00:04.987 --> 00:00:09.388
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.438 --> 00:00:12.873
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.924 --> 00:00:16.587
Today we learn about Online Privacy. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.989 --> 00:00:21.947
Privacy. Say it with me. Privacy!

6
00:00:25.447 --> 00:00:29.870
Personal data. Say it with me. Personal data!

7
00:00:33.372 --> 00:00:36.905
Cookie. Say it with me. Cookie!

8
00:00:40.414 --> 00:00:45.231
Terms of service. Say it with me. Terms of service!

9
00:00:48.721 --> 00:00:52.772
Permission. Say it with me. Permission!

10
00:00:56.314 --> 00:01:01.314
Location sharing. Say it with me. Location sharing!

11
00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:09.589
Data collection. Say it with me. Data collection!

12
00:01:13.057 --> 00:01:17.566
Opt out. Say it with me. Opt out!

13
00:01:21.012 --> 00:01:36.978
Protecting my privacy means being careful with my personal data online. A website might use a cookie or ask permission for location sharing, often explained in its terms of service. I can sometimes opt out of unwanted data collection.

14
00:01:37.028 --> 00:01:40.263
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:41.027 --> 00:01:46.461
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:46.511 --> 00:01:47.661
Cookie!

17
00:01:48.681 --> 00:01:54.039
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:54.089 --> 00:01:55.616
Data collection!

19
00:01:56.598 --> 00:02:06.191
Did you know? Many apps collect more personal data than most people realize, which is why checking privacy settings matters!

20
00:02:06.241 --> 00:02:08.839
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:09.718 --> 00:02:20.916
Think and answer. Why should you read a website's terms of service, at least the basics?

22
00:02:20.966 --> 00:02:22.286
Great answer!

23
00:02:23.145 --> 00:02:28.860
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:32.005
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

